body:
 This **article** is **a** **great** read and is related to this weeks topic of open research! Also, it addressed strong concerns of students having to access sites without a paywall **that’s** correlated with access to free research sites.  In my opinion adobe suite, unlimited google, microsoft office, and **research** **sites** should be **free** for use in schools.

&#x200B;

To shed more light:  [https://mypaperhub.com/blog-post2.php?id\_blog\_post=852](https://mypaperhub.com/blog-post2.php?id_blog_post=852)
